    <summary type="text">The rete is the pierced plate that turns over the plate.</summary>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The <em>rete</em> is the pierced plate that turns over the tympan. Its pointers are stars.</p>
